{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"30","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Accounting"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A long time ago in some far country lived king Copa. After the recent king's reform, he got so large powers that started to keep the books by himself."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The total income "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"A"},{"kind":"text","text":" of his kingdom during "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th year is known, as well as the total income "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B"},{"kind":"text","text":" during "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th year (these numbers can be negative — it means that there was a loss in the correspondent year). "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"King wants to show financial stability. To do this, he needs to find common coefficient "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"X"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the coefficient of income growth during one year. This coefficient should satisfy the equation:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"A·Xn = B."}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Surely, the king is not going to do this job by himself, and demands you to find such number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"X"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is necessary to point out that the fractional numbers are not used in kingdom's economy. That's why all input numbers as well as coefficient "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"X"},{"kind":"text","text":" must be integers. The number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"X"},{"kind":"text","text":" may be zero or negative."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The input contains three integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"A"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|A|, |B| ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 10"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output the required integer coefficient "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"X"},{"kind":"text","text":", or «No solution», if such a coefficient does not exist or it is fractional. If there are several possible solutions, output any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 18 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role